bae\\u0bcd \\u0b85\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0bb0\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0b9a\\u0bc6\\u0baf\\u0bcd\\u0baf\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd!\\n\\n#Cancel_TNPSCGroup4", "\\u201cContradictions in the DMK alliance are becoming more pronounced with each passing day. What we see today is a government more focused on consolidating power than alleviating the pain of the people.\\n\\nThe people of Tamil Nadu clearly see through this \\u2014 they are experiencing the effects of arrogance, not governance. A Chief Minister must be a symbol of humility, compassion, and action \\u2014 not one who projects himself as the best without fulfilling the basic promises made to the public.", "Under the aiadmk.official , Tamil Nadu was a model of good governance. We delivered on the ground. We understood the struggles of farmers, fishermen, and the poor. We protected Cauvery water rights, rolled out Amma canteens, and prioritised the welfare of every section \\u2014 from women to students to entrepreneurs.", "Let us rise above vendetta politics. Let us return to a politics of service, integrity, and results. Our time will come \\u2014 not through media management or orchestrated campaigns \\u2014 but through the will of the people.\\u201d", "\\u0bae\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0ba9\\u0bbe\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0b9f\\u0bbf, \\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0b9f\\u0bc8\\u0bae\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bc2\\u0bb0\\u0bcd, \\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0b95\\u0bcb\\u0ba3\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b9a\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bae\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0bb1 \\u0ba4\\u0bca\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\n\\n \\n#\\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u0bb0\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0bb4\\u0bb0\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd_\\u0b8e\\u0bb4\\u0bc1\\u0b9a\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0baf\\u0ba3\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\n#\\u0bae\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc8\\u0b95\\u0bcd_\\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bcb\\u0bae\\u0bcd\\n#\\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0bb4\\u0b95\\u0