 Minister Shri. narendramodi ji\\n\\n#ModiGovtAgainstTerror", "Our Hon\\u2019ble Prime Minister Shri. narendramodi ji responded fittingly in today\\u2019s Lok Sabha assembly of the Monsoon Session, reiterating India\\u2019s strong stance against any act of terrorism. Terrorists once acted without fear, knowing there would be no consequences. However, that has changed now under our Hon\\u2019ble Prime Minister Shri narendramodi ji\\u2019s leadership. Today, India hits back with strength and indomitable in its spirit. Today, all those behind these heinous attacks are no longer safe because we strike", "attacks are no longer safe because we strike them right where they are. This is the new normal.", "#ModiGovtAgainstTerror", "Hon\\u2019ble Home Minister Shri amitshahofficial Ji, during #MonsoonSession2025, reaffirmed the Modi Govt\\u2019s zero-tolerance policy towards terrorism. During the speech, the Hon\\u2019ble Home Minister highlighted the success of #OperationMahadev, which eliminated those who carried out the heinous Pahalgam terror attack. He also stated that #OperationSindoor eliminated those who masterminded the attack, ensuring complete justice.", "From surgical strikes and Balakot airstrikes to revoking Article 370, the government has shown that decisive action, not dialogue, is the answer to terror.\\nUnder Hon\\u2019ble PM Shri. narendramodi Ji\\u2019s leadership, national security is non-negotiable. India speaks from a position of strength and acts without hesitation when its sovereignty is challenged."], "model": "voyage-multilingual-2", "input_type": "document", "truncation": true, "output_dtype": "float", "output_dimension": 1024, "encoding_format": "base64"}' message='Post details'
