2026-01-28 17:02:39,182 [DEBUG] voyage - data='{"input": ["In keeping with the divine words of Jesus Christ \\u2013 \\u201cLove your neighbour as yourself\\u201d \\u2013 these nuns were deeply involved in noble services such as providing education and healthcare to the tribal communities of Chhattisgarh. Their spirit of service deserves utmost appreciation. Instead of recognising and encouraging such selfless work done in the spirit of \\u201cServing the poor is serving God\\u201d, the Chhattisgarh government, fuelled by religious hatred, has chosen to accept a baseless complaint and imprison them,", "to accept a baseless complaint and imprison them, thereby crushing their humanitarian mission.", "Christians across Kerala and several other states have been staging widespread protests demanding their release. But treating these nuns like hardened criminals and refusing to free them is nothing but blatant religious bigotry. It is appalling that the BJP government has misused the anti-conversion law enacted during the previous Congress regime in Chhattisgarh to imprison these two nuns.", "Since Narendra Modi and the BJP came to power in India 11 years ago, attacks on Muslims and Christians have been steadily increasing. Particularly in BJP-ruled Manipur, brutal attacks on Christians have continued unabated for months. The BJP govt has created an environment in which Muslims and Christians cannot live peacefully in India.\\n\\nWhy does the BJP fear Muslims and Christians so much? Why such insecurity? Is your religion so weak? Is religion meant for people, or are people meant for religion?", "- #Seeman | #NTK", "\\u0b86\\u0ba3\\u0bb5\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bca\\u0bb2\\u0bc8 \\u0b9a\\u0bc6\\u0baf\\u0bcd\\u0baf\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f \\u0ba4\\u0bc2\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0b9f\\u0bbf \\u0b86\\u0bb1\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bae\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb2\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0