0b8e\\u0ba3\\u0bcd: 1057\\n\\n\\u0b95\\u0bb2\\u0bc8\\u0b9e\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0b89\\u0bb0\\u0bc8:\\n\\n\\u0b87\\u0bb4\\u0bbf\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0baa\\u0bcd \\u0baa\\u0bc7\\u0b9a\\u0bbe\\u0bae\\u0bb2\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd, \\u0b8f\\u0bb3\\u0ba9\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u0bb0\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bbe\\u0bae\\u0bb2\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0bb5\\u0bb4\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bbf\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0bb5\\u0bb3\\u0bcd\\u0bb3\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0bae\\u0bc8 \\u0b89\\u0b9f\\u0bc8\\u0baf\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc8\\u0b95\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0ba3\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bcb\\u0ba4\\u0bc1, \\u0b87\\u0bb0\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bcb\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0b89\\u0bb3\\u0bcd\\u0bb3\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0bae\\u0b95\\u0bbf\\u0bb4\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bbe\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0b87\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0bb1\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd.\\n\\n#\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bb1\\u0bb3\\u0bcd", "\\u0ba8\\u0bae\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bb2\\u0bae\\u0bc8\\u0b9a\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bb0\\u0bcd mkstalin \\u0b85\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd #\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bbe\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0b9f_\\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0b9f\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0b86\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0bb5\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0ba3\\u0bbe\\u0bae\\u0bb2\\u0bc8\\u0baf\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0b89\\u0ba4\\u0baf\\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0b95\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0b85\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4 #TIDELNeo \\u0ba4\\u0b95\\u0bb5\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bca\\u0bb4\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd\\u0ba8\\u0bc1\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0baa \\u0baa\\u0bc2\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bbe\\ud83c\\udf1f\\n\\nYet another #TIDEL Neo Park, yet another step towards further distributed growth across Tamil Nadu !\\n\\nHonourable Chief Minister of Tamil Nadu Thiru. MK Stalin avargal today laid the foundation stone for the TIDEL Neo Park in #Tiruvannamalai.", "TIDEL tech parks are crucial gateways to opportunity for our talented youth who deserve world-class infrastructure and  jobs near their homes. \\n\\nWith modern IT infrastructure, these hubs are designed to nurture startups, attract tech companies, and enable youth from Tier 2 and 3 towns to build careers without having to migrate.\\n\\nTiruvannamalai joins the growing network of TIDEL Neo Parks across Tamil Nadu, from Villupuram and Thanjavur to Thoothukudi and Salem.", "With this latest addition, we reaffirm our commitment to bridging regional disparities to unlock the potential of every district.\\n\\n#TiruvannamalaiRising #DravidianModel #InvestInTN #JobsForTN #BullishOnTN", "Tamil Nadu has conquered EV bikes and cars, now it\\u2019s time to ramp up our efforts towards EV buses and public charging infra!\\n\\nI participated in the Passenger Vehicle Expo 2.0 at the Chennai Trade Centre, organised by the All Omni Bus Owners Association and allied transport associations across South India and shared views on this sector.", "This year\\u2019s edition was particularly special with electric omnibuses taking centre stage, and much of the conversation was about public charging infrastructure which is crucial to make EVs succesful. \\n\\nAmidst ongoing trade shifts, the event was a strong reminder that India\\u2019s shift to self-reliance in public transport and fleet modernisation is gathering speed, and Tamil Nadu is proudly leading the charge.", "At the event, I emphasised that Tamil Nadu is future-ready. We are prepared for anything the world throws at us because our fundamentals are strong and we are a professionally-run government under the visionary leadership of Honourable Chief Minister of Tamil Nadu Thiru. MK Stalin avargal.\\n\\nThanks to AOBOA and the organisers, especially my brother Anbu, for bringing together over 100 exhibitors and thousands of participants to drive the conversation forward.", "#InvestInTN #BullishOnTN #DravidianModel #JobsForTN", "Pleased to host Jorgan K. Andrews, Charg\\u00e9 d\\u2019Affaires; Chris Hodges, U.S. Consul General in Chennai ; Brian Smyser, Chief of the Political & Economic Section; and Edith Yuh, Vice Consul, at my camp office today. \\n\\nWe discussed Tamil Nadu\\u2019s digital transformation journey, covering ground from AI-led innovation, cybersecurity and public digital infrastructure to sharing our vision of building resilient, future-ready tech ecosystems through cross-border partnerships.", "Raised critical questions to MoHFW_INDIA on India\\u2019s evolving medical devices policy:\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udd39Will India set up a dedicated Medical Devices Authority\\u2014separate from drug-centric CDSCO?\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udd39 Is a public adverse events database like US FDA\\u2019s MAUDE or EU\\u2019s EUDAMED in the works?\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udd39 Are AI-driven Software as Medical Devices (SaMD) being brought under clear regulation?\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udd39 Will value-based procurement & Health Tech Assessments guide smarter device adoption?", "\\ud83d\\udd39 Any move to rationalise GST on life-saving devices to make healthcare more affordable?\\n\\nIndia needs smart, specialised regulation. \\n\\n#MedTechIndia #HealthcareInnovation #HealthForAll\\n\\nmkstalin udhay_stalin arivalayam dmkyouthwing DMKITwing dmksdwing  DMKChennai", "\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0b9a\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4 \\u0b95\\u0bb2\\u0bcd\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bbe\\u0bb3\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bcb\\u0bb4\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0bb5\\u0b9a\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0ba4\\u0bc7\\u0bb5\\u0bbf \\u0b85\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0bae\\u0bb1\\u0bc8\\u0bb5\\u0bc8 \\u0baa\\u0bc6\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b87\\u0bb4\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bbe\\u0b95 \\u0b95\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0bc7\\u0ba9\\u0bcd.\\n\\n\\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0ba4\\u0