\\u0bc1 \\u0ba8\\u0b9f\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b92\\u0bb0\\u0bc1 Usual \\u0bae\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0bb5 \\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1, \\u0b89\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bcd \\u0baa\\u0bc6\\u0baf\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0bb5\\u0bc8\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0bb3\\u0bae\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bb0\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b9a\\u0bc6\\u0baf\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bca\\u0bb3\\u0bcd\\u0bb3 \\u0bb5\\u0bc6\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0b95 \\u0b87\\u0bb2\\u0bcd\\u0bb2\\u0bc8\\u0baf\\u0bbe \\u0bb8\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bbe\\u0bb2\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd?", "\\"#\\u0ba8\\u0bb2\\u0bae\\u0bcd_\\u0b95\\u0bc6\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd_\\u0bb8\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bbe\\u0bb2\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\"\\n\\u0b8e\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0ba4\\u0bc7 \\u0b89\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bcd \\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bc1 \\u0b86\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd SUMMARY!\\n\\n#ByeByeStalin", "MK Stalin\\u2019s Article on Education: A Tale of Half-Truths and Credit Stealing!\\n\\nPuppet CM mkstalin\\u2019s op-ed article in today\\u2019s The Hindu, claiming that Tamil Nadu\\u2019s education success is the result of the \\u201cStalin Model,\\u201d is not just misleading \\u2014 it\\u2019s a blatant attempt to rewrite history and hijack the achievements of the aiadmk.official governments that actually built the foundations of equity in education.", "Let\\u2019s begin with the Midday Meal Scheme, which he refers to with pride. While it originated in 1920 under the Madras Corporation, it was Puratchi Thalaivar Dr. M.G.R, who universalised and scaled it across Tamil Nadu in the 1980s \\u2014 making it a landmark scheme that drew global appreciation. That\\u2019s when education began transforming lives at the grassroots.", "MK Stalin also boasts about the Breakfast Scheme as a DMK innovation. The truth is, the scheme was first launched by #AIADMK under the leadership of Hon\'ble Annan Puratchi Thamizhar eps.tamilnadu Avl in 2019, covering government school students from Class 1 to 5 in select districts as a pilot programme. It was part of a holistic nutrition + education strategy. DMK merely revamped and reannounced it with publicity, while failing to ensure proper implementation \\u2014 with several schools today reporting poor", "\\u2014 with several schools today reporting poor food quality and irregular supply.", "He celebrates the milestone of 135 students from Adi Dravidar and Tribal Welfare schools entering top institutes. A commendable achievement indeed \\u2014 but the real credit goes to the long-term ecosystem built by AIADMK: from free hostels and entrance coaching centres to laptops, scholarships, and residential schooling support that empowered first-generation learners.", "Perhaps the most misleading claim is about Tamil Nadu achieving a Gross Enrolment Ratio (GER) of 47.3% in higher education. This didn\\u2019t happen in three years. According to official data from the All India Survey on Higher Education (AISHE), Tamil Nadu\\u2019s GER rose from 19.3% in 2011 to 51.4% by 2020 \\u2014 entirely during AIADMK\\u2019s governance. What MK Stalin is flaunting today is the result of our policy continuity, targeted welfare, and school-to-college pipeline strengthening \\u2014 not a fresh achievement under DMK.", "Even", "#\\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u0bb0\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0bb4\\u0bb0\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd_\\u0b8e\\u0bb4\\u0bc1\\u0b9a\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0baf\\u0ba3\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b9a\\u0bc1\\u0bb1\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0bc1\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0baf\\u0ba3\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0b92\\u0bb0\\u0bc1 \\u0baa\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bbe\\u0b95,\\n\\n\\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0b95\\u0bb4\\u0b95\\u0baa\\u0bcd \\u0baa\\u0bca\\u0ba