2026-01-28 17:07:10,670 [DEBUG] voyage - data='{"input": ["The time when we firmly believed that people determine election outcomes has come to an end.These days, the moment the Election Commission releases the voter list, the election result is almost decided. It is deeply painful to witness the democracy we built and protected collapsing before our eyes..The Election Commission of India has become a puppet in the hands of the BJP.", "You may belong to another political party\\u00a0 but if you truly believe in democracy, this should shake you to the core. This is no longer about party lines or electoral rivalry. This is about the very foundation of our Republic being dismantled in broad daylight. The erosion of a free and fair electoral process threatens every citizen, every political ideology, and the future of India itself. If we stay silent now, there may be no democracy left to fight for tomorrow.\\n\\n#votechori", "\\u0ba4\\u0ba9\\u0bbf \\u0bae\\u0ba9\\u0bbf\\u0ba4 \\u0bb5\\u0bb3\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bc7 \\u0b9a\\u0bae\\u0bc2\\u0b95\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0bb5\\u0bb3\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bbf", "We want discussion on #votechori", "Thank you, Ambassador, for the warm hospitality and for strengthening the bridge between #TamilNadu and #Denmark in key sectors like water and energy. Looking forward to deeper cooperation for mutual growth. \\ud83e\\udd1d", "\\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0bb4\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0bb5\\u0bb3\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0b95\\u0bb5\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd, \\u0bb5\\u0bc6\\u0bb1\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0b95\\u0bb5\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b85\\u0baf\\u0bb0\\u0bbe\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0baa\\u0bbe\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0baa\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f  \\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0bae\\u0bc8\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bb3\\u0baa\\