2026-01-28 17:08:55,644 [DEBUG] voyage - data='{"input": ["In times of silence, he speaks truth. In times of fear, he stands tall.\\n\\nHappy to met Hon\'ble LoP #LeaderOfThePeople , Shri rahulgandhi ji.\\n\\n#INDIA #RahulGandhi #Congress #Democracy", "VIDEO | When asked about Opposition MPs wearing a specific T-shirt during their protest inside Parliament premises, Congress MP Manickam Tagore says, \\"The level of ECI\'s failure can be understood, the ECI under Rajiv Kumar, Gyanesh Kumar has become a department of the BJP. They have completely failed. For example, Mita Devi is first-time voter, but 124 years old. We want a discussion on this subject. There is a fake voter list, there are fake names. We want to expose, as a mark of protest, we are wearing", "to expose, as a mark of protest, we are wearing this T-shirt...\\"", "#MonsoonSession2025", "The opposition\'s new revelation claims a 124-year-old first-time voter registered in Bihar, protested at Parliament\'s Makar Dwar", "#WATCH | Congress MP Manickam Tagore says, \\"The failed Election Commission of Rajeev Kumar and Gyanesh Kumar is murdering the elections. The democratic process of India has been attacked by both Election Commissioners. They have compromised the Election Commission as the BJP\'s department. An example is Minta Devi, who is a first-time voter and her age is 124 years... We want a discussion on the SIR as well as the vote theft issue...\\"", "The failed Election Commission of Rajeev Kumar and Gyanesh Kumar is murdering the elections. The democratic process of India has been attacked by both Election Commissioners. They have compromised the Election Commission as the BJP\'s department. An example is Minta Devi, who is a first-time voter and her age is 124 years... We want a discussion on the SIR as well as the vote theft issue...\\"\\n\\n#VoteChori #sir #mintadevi #bjpscam #ElectionCommission", "#WATCH | Delhi | On INDIA bloc leaders\' march to the Election Commission today, Congress MP Manickam Tagore says, \\"For the past 14 days, we have been demanding a discussion in the Parliament for SIR and vote theft... The government is not allowing the discussions and pushed 3 Bills in more than 30 minutes... BJP starting to speak on behalf of the EC is dangerous for the country... We walked up to the EC today from the Parliament; we were stopped midway and taken to the police station... EC has become an", "taken to the police station... EC has become an agent for BJP and hence we demand a discussion on it...\\" (11.08)", "VIDEO | Delhi: Congress MP Manickam Tagore says, \\"...We wanted to meet the Election Commission, but Delhi Police stopped us. The government passed three bills today, and the way they are bulldozing parliamentary processes is dangerous. We will stress for a discussion on SIR and the \'vote theft\' issue tomorrow.\\"", "\\u0b87\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0baf \\u0ba4\\u0bc7\\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u0baf \\u0bb2\\u0bc0\\u0b95\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bbf \\u0b9a\\u0bbe\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bbe\\u0b95 \\u0b86\\u0b9f\\u0bbf 26\\u0b86\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0bb3\\u0bcd 11-08-2025 \\u0b9a\\u0bc6\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0ba9\\u0bc8 \\u0bae\\u0bc8\\u0bb2\\u0bbe\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc2\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0b9a\\u0bbf.\\u0b90.\\u0b9f\\u0bbf. \\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0b9f\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u0baa\\u0bcd \\u0baa\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0b89\\u0bb3\\u0bcd\\u0bb3 \\u0b95\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bcb \\u0bae\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \'\\u0b8e\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0ba8\\u0bae\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0ba9 \\u0b85\\u0bb0\\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd?\' \\u0b8e\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0bb1 \\u0ba4\\u0bb2\\u0bc8\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0ba8\\u0b9f\\u0bc8\\u0baa\\u0bc6\\u0bb1\\u0bcd\\u0bb1 \\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0baa\\u0bc6\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bb0\\u0b99\\u0bc