9f\\u0bbe\\u0bb2\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0b85\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b87\\u0ba4\\u0baf\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc2\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0bb5\\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0ba9 \\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0ba3\\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0bb3\\u0bcd \\u0ba8\\u0bb2\\u0bcd\\u0bb5\\u0bbe\\u0bb4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bcd.\\n\\n\\u0b89\\u0b99\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bcd \\u0b87\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0bb5\\u0bbe\\u0bb4\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc8\\u0baf\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd\\n\\u0b85\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0bae\\u0b95\\u0bbf\\u0bb4\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0ba8\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0bc8\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0ba4\\u0bbe\\u0b95,\\n\\u0ba8\\u0bc0\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0b9f \\u0b86\\u0baf\\u0bc1\\u0bb3\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0ba8\\u0bb2\\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0bb5\\u0bb3\\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd\\n\\u0b8e\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bca\\u0b9f\\u0bb0 \\u0bae\\u0ba9\\u0ba4\\u0bbe\\u0bb0 \\u0bb5\\u0bbe\\u0bb4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0bc7\\u0ba9\\u0bcd.", "\\u0baa\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0ba4\\u0bae\\u0bb0\\u0bcd,\\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bb2\\u0bcd\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd,\\n\\u0b85\\u0bae\\u0bc8\\u0b9a\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bcd \\u0b9a\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bbf \\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bb1\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0bb5\\u0bbe\\u0bb3\\u0bbf \\u0b8e\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0bc1 \\u0ba8\\u0bc0\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bae\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbe\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0b9f\\u0bbe\\u0bae\\u0bb2\\u0bcd, \\u0b85\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0bb0 \\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0bb7\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0baf\\u0bcb\\u0b95\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbe\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bc8\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0b9a\\u0bc6\\u0baf\\u0bcd\\u0baf\\u0baa\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bc1, 30 \\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0bae\\u0bc7\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0b9a\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0bc8\\u0baf\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbe\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bc2\\u0b9f  31 \\u0bb5\\u0ba4\\u0bc1  \\u0ba8\\u0bbe\\u0bb3\\u0bcd \\u0baa\\u0ba4\\u0bb5\\u0bbf \\u0ba4\\u0bbe\\u0ba9\\u0bbe\\u0b95\\u0bb5\\u0bc7 \\u0baa\\u0bcb\\u0baf\\u0bcd\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b8e\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0bc1 \\u0b9a\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b87\\u0baf\\u0bb1\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0bc1\\u0bb5\\u0ba4\\u0bb2\\u0bcd\\u0bb2\\u0bbe\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b9a\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0bb5\\u0bbe\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bbe\\u0bb0\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0b89\\u0b9a\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bae\\u0bcd.", "#voteathikariyatra", "Today offered my heartfelt tribute to Rajiv ji on his birth anniversary at Veer Bhoomi, remembering his vision and enduring legacy. #Rajivgandhi", "Today, on the birth anniversary of\\u00a0 Rajiv Gandhi ji, we remember a leader whose vision and determination shaped modern India. As our youngest Prime Minister, he brought energy, dynamism, and a futuristic outlook to national leadership.Rajiv Gandhi believed deeply in the power of technology, education, Women and\\u00a0 youth to transform our nation. His pioneering efforts in ushering India into the digital age, expanding telecom connectivity, and strengthening Panchayati Raj empowered millions at the grassroots.", "Raj empowered millions at the grassroots. He was also a leader who understood that India\\u2019s progress lay in blending tradition with innovation, and in placing faith in the aspirations of the young.", "His legacy continues to inspire generations to dream big and to build an India that is strong, inclusive, and forward-looking.\\n\\nOn this day, we pay homage to\\u00a0 Rajiv Gandhi ji \\u2014 a visionary leader, a true democrat, and a guiding force for a modern India.", "The 130th Constitutional Amendment is not reform.\\nIt is a Black Bill introduced on a Black Day.\\n\\n\\ud83d\\udc49 30-day arrest = Removal of an elected CM.\\nNo trial. No conviction. Just BJP\\u2019s diktat.\\n\\nThis is how dictatorships begin.\\n#BlackBill #BlackDay\\n\\nThe Union BJP Govt, shaken by the #VoteTheft expos\\u00e9, is desperate to distract the nation.\\n\\nInstead of answering on stolen mandates, they now want to topple elected CMs and silence Opposition leaders through this unconstitutional Bill.\\n#VoteChori #VoteAdhikarYatra", "This Bill gives the PM & HM the power to foist false cases on opponents, misuse arrests, and remove leaders without trial.\\n\\n\\u26a0\\ufe0f First step of every dictator: grab the power to arrest rivals.\\n\\nThat\\u2019s exactly what this Bill seeks to do.\\n#BlackDay\\n\\nToday in Lok Sabha, during k.c.venugopal ji\\u2019s strong opposition to this Bill, an ugly scene unfolded:", "\\ud83d\\udccc Parliamentary Affairs Minister Kiren Rijiju left his seat, came shouting at woman MPs, with Minister Bittu following.\\n\\ud83d\\udccc HM Amit Shah ji himself had to send Rijiju back.\\n\\ud83d\\udccc You can clearly hear Mr Kiren Rijiju\\u2019s voice in this video.\\n\\nA Parliamentary Affairs Minister behaving in such an unparliamentary way \\u2014 shameful.", "Justice Sudershan Reddy has decades of judicial and legal experience. As a champion of constitutional values, he is popular across party lines.\\n\\nNotably, he worked on the Telangana caste census and helped craft a vision for social justice for Telangana.", "I happened to look inside his pocket, and to my surprise, he had a copy of the Constitution of India. He carries it everywhere. He mentioned that he has been carrying the Constitution for 52 years and emphasized that in any conversation, the Constitution has the final say. \\n\\nHe is a wise and ideologically aligned person.\\n\\n: LoP Shri rahulgandhi ji", "Joined Lok Sabha Speaker Sh. Om Birla ji, INC President mallikarjunkhargeinc ji, CPP Chairperson Smt. Sonia Gandhi ji and other senior leaders across the political spectrum in offering floral tributes to Bharat Ratna Sh. Rajiv Gandhi ji in Centrall Hall, Samvidhan Sadan today.", "Opposition parties facilitated their vice-presidential nominee, former Supreme Court Judge Shri B. Sudershan Reddy, in the Central Hall of Samvidhan Sadan.\\n\\nToday, the nation needs an exemplary, impartial voice, and he is the ideal choice for the esteemed position. \\n\\n\\ud83d\\udccd New Delhi"], "model": "voyage-multilingual-2", "input_type": "document", "truncation": true, "output_dtype": "float", "output_dimension": 1024, "encoding_format": "base64"}' message='Post details'
