2026-01-28 17:13:05,437 [DEBUG] voyage - data='{"input": ["\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0ba3 \\u0bb5\\u0bbe\\u0bb4\\u0bcd\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0b90\\u0bae\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0b86\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc8 \\u0ba8\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0bc8\\u0bb5\\u0bc1 \\u0b9a\\u0bc6\\u0baf\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bb4\\u0b95\\u0ba4\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bb2\\u0bc8\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd - \\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bb2\\u0bae\\u0bc8\\u0b9a\\u0bcd\\u0b9a\\u0bb0\\u0bcd \\u0b85\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0ba3\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1. \\u0bae\\u0bc1.\\u0b95.\\u0bb8\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bbe\\u0bb2\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0b85\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd, \\u0b85\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0ba3\\u0bbf \\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0bb0\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bc1. \\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bbe \\u0bb8\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bbe\\u0bb2\\u0bbf\\u0ba9\\u0bcd \\u0b85\\u0bb5\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b8e\\u0ba9\\u0ba4\\u0bc1 \\u0bae\\u0ba9\\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0bb0\\u0bcd\\u0ba8\\u0bcd\\u0ba4 \\u0bb5\\u0bbe\\u0bb4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bb3\\u0bc8\\u0ba4\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bc6\\u0bb0\\u0bbf\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0ba4\\u0bcd\\u0ba4\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bca\\u0bb3\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bbf\\u0bb1\\u0bc7\\u0ba9\\u0bcd.", "Remembering former Prime Minister Thiru. Rajiv Gandhi on his 81st birth anniversary. His vision for technology, education, and empowering the youth laid the foundation for a modern India. His life and courage will always be remembered.", "Historic, Unprecedented, Unmatched ! \\n\\nTamil Nadu\\u2019s industrial growth journey under Honourable Chief Minister of Tamil Nadu Thiru. MK Stalin avargal continues to break records and set new benchmarks for the nation ! \\n\\nI am proud to share that we\\u2019ve achieved a 77% conversion rate on all the investment MoUs signed since 2021, up from the 72% declared during the last assembly session and the highest Tamil Nadu has ever seen !", "Further, a massive 80% of the MoUs signed at #TNGIM2024 have been grounded and progressing well !\\n\\nWe\\u2019re not slowing down, in fact shifting gears to move faster. Following the resounding success in Thoothukudi, two more #TNRising regional investor conclaves have been confirmed - Hosur on the 11th of September and later in Coimbatore.", "We are also preparing for the big international edition of #TNRisingEurope, with Honourable Chief Minister leading the delegation to Germany and the UK. He will be leaving on the 30th morning 9am and returning on the 8th morning at 8am.\\n\\nMany more exciting announcements coming up !\\n\\n#InvestInTN #BullishOnTN #JobsForTN #DravidianModel", "Come what may, we must keep moving forward !\\ud83d\\ude4f\\ud83c\\udffe\\n\\nSectoral GCCs are the way to go for Tamil Nadu ! \\n\\nAt Guidance Tamil Nadu this afternoon, I had the opportunity to meet with senior leadership from Expeditors International, a Fortune 500 global logistics and supply chain leader headquartered in Seattle.", "The senior leadership shared their vision for expanding Expeditors\\u2019 footprint in India in alignment with their global growth strategy. Tamil Nadu\\u2019s strength as a destination for high-end, high-skill GCCs makes us attractive for global clients.\\n\\nUnder the leadership of Honourable Chief Minister of Tamil Nadu Thiru. MK Stalin avargal, our state is actively making Tamil Nadu a hub for GCCs and integrated global supply chain solutions.\\n\\n#InvestInTN #BullishOnTN #JobsForTN #DravidianModel", "\\u0bae\\u0bbe\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bbf\\u0b95\\u0bc1 \\u0ba4\\u0b95\\u0bb5\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0ba4\\u0bca\\u0bb4\\u0bbf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd\\u0ba8\\u0bc1\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0baa\\u0bb5\\u0bbf\\u0baf\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0bae\\u0bb1\\u0bcd\\u0bb1\\u0bc1\\u0bae\\u0bcd \\u0b9f\\u0bbf\\u0b9c\\u0bbf\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bb2