o force can halt our journey. Our goal is firm, our rise unstoppable. \\n\\nTo every investor I say, travel with Tamil Nadu and your success is guaranteed. Tamil Nadu will keep on rising.\\n\\ntrbrajaa guidancetamilnaduofficial\\n\\n#BullishonTN #InvestInTN #JobsforTN #DravidianModel", "#Hosur\\u2019s next era of growth is here! \\n\\n\\ud83d\\udcdd At #TNRising Investors Conclave in Hosur, 92 MoUs were signed across large industries and MSMEs, with investments totalling Rs. 24,307 crore and employment opportunities for 49,353 people.\\n\\n\\ud83c\\udfd7\\ufe0f Construction commencement ceremony was held for the second unit of Ascent Circuits at the ELCOT SEZ.\\n\\n\\u26a1 Groundbreaking ceremonies were held for Delta Electronics\\u2019 new manufacturing units, along with the inauguration of its cutting-edge Smart Manufacturing Line.", "\\ud83d\\ude80 Four ambitious projects were inaugurated \\u2014 Kaynes Circuits, Shoolagiri Future Mobility Park, SNS Clothing (Gokaldas Exports), and the Tamil Nadu Innovation Board.\\n\\n\\ud83e\\uddf1 Foundation stones were laid for Kauvery Hospital, RICO Auto, Aspire Footwear, and Versatile Bonds. \\n\\n\\ud83d\\udc69\\u200d\\ud83d\\udcbc Job orders were handed over to newly recruited employees at Tata Electronics, Kaynes Circuits, HL Mando, and First Steps Babywear.", "Just four days after returning from the #TNRising in UK and Germany, we are in Hosur posting bigger numbers in investments. We are breaking our own records! \\n\\ntrbrajaa guidancetamilnaduofficial\\n\\n#BullishonTN #InvestInTN #JobsforTN #DravidianModel", "\\u0ba4\\u0bc0\\u0ba3\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bbe\\u0bae\\u0bc8, \\u0b87\\u0bb0\\u0b9f\\u0bcd\\u0b9f\\u0bc8\\u0b95\\u0bcd \\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0bb5\\u0bb3\\u0bc8 \\u0bae\\u0bc1\\u0bb1\\u0bc8, \\u0b9a\\u0bbe\\u0ba4\\u0bbf\\u0baf \\u0b92\\u0b9f\\u0bc1\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0ba4\\u0bb2\\u0bcd \\u0baa\\u0bcb\\u0ba9\\u0bcd\\u0bb1 \\u0b9a\\u0bae\\u0bc2\\u0b95\\u0b9a\\u0bcd \\u0b9a\\u0bb4\\u0b95\\u0bcd\\u0b95\\u0bc1\\u0b